As demonstrated in Table \ref{tab:hardware.list}, the Samoyeds kernel is compatible with most prevalent GPUs, including NVIDIA GPUs that incorporate Ampere architecture or more advanced versions\cite{nvidiaptx}, as well as AMD GPUs that are equipped with CDNA3 architecture\cite{amdcdnaISA}, which all satisfy the mandatory requirement for sparse ALU.
