In this section, we evaluate the performance of analogs forecast in more complex processes: the GOY pseudo-velocity field generated from Eq.\eqref{eq:pseudov} and an experimental turbulent velocity signal. Both processes exhibit multiscale dynamics, an energy cascade, and intermittency. In both cases, we are able to link extreme events in velocity increments to unpredictable events.

