	\caption{The square and $(\lambda_\mp \otimes \lambda_\pm)\circ (I_\pm \otimes (u_\mp \circ n_\mp) \otimes I_\mp)\circ (Y_\pm \otimes Y_\mp)$ are isotopic.}
